<title>USA: CompuMed says president, ceo leaves firm.</title>
<headline>CompuMed says president, ceo leaves firm.</headline>
<dateline>MANHATTAN BEACH, Calif 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>CompuMed Inc said Tuesday its president and chief executive officer, Rod Raynovich, is no longer associated with the company.</p>
<p>While the board of directors conducts a search for his successor, James Linesch, the company's chief financial officer, will assume the duties of acting CEO.</p>
<p>CompuMed develops solutions to medical problems through the use of computer technology.</p>
